<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/postOfficeBoxNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The number that identifies a PO box. A PO box is a box in a post office or other postal service location assigned to an organization where postal items may be kept."@en .
